# the switch: the fixed crossbar (DUMMY, default) or the WireGuard data path
# (disassembler, decryptor, IP lookup, encryptor, peer table). To switch,
# comment out the DUMMY line and uncomment the eight below it (Vivado: the
# same in 3.build/hw_build.Vivado/wireguard.xpr). Lint and LEQ black-box
# the ChaCha20-Poly1305 cores; a build or simulation of dpe_switch.sv also
# needs 3.build/pypeline_build/soc/chacha20poly1305_{encrypt,decrypt}.v.gz
# unpacked. The 4.sim/rtl/dpe bench checks the DUMMY's routing
